{"id":"wb-7-1654","name":"呼和浩特天主教堂","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"呼和浩特天主教堂","text":"呼和浩特耶稣圣心主教座堂是天主教绥远总教区的主教座堂，位于内蒙古自治区呼和浩特市回民区。\n呼和浩特天主教堂建于1922-1924年，罗马式建筑风格，红色外墙，门窗为半圆拱形，十字平面。钟楼高30米。\n2006年9月4日，呼和浩特天主教堂公布为第四批内蒙古自治区文物保护单位。2013年3月5日公布为第七批全国重点文物保护单位","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%91%BC%E5%92%8C%E6%B5%A9%E7%89%B9%E5%A4%A9%E4%B8%BB%E6%95%99%E5%A0%82","revisionId":89208412,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=89208412","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cc705bcf1ca7217d37ad3fdc.jpg","title":"Hohhot_Cathedral.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Hohhot_Cathedral.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d0/Hohhot_Cathedral.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zophas","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​呼和浩特天主教堂外景","width":320,"height":340}}